WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Convert binary to decimal

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Start at the rightmost digit with weight 1.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.220
Double the weight at each position as you move left.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:16.220
Add only the weights where the digit is 1.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:21.710
10110₂ equals 16 + 4 + 2, so the decimal value is 22.
